A||||2||80's BOY||anyone experienced with inventions or patents??||||14||
Z||000000||80's BOY||01-03-2001||11:21 PM||||i have an idea for an automobile accessory. my target audience is hunters/ranchers who carry rifles in their pickups or SUV's. i contacted a middleman patent company called "DAVIDSON'S" who assists people in these things. they did a 20 year patent search, and found no match to my idea/product. they also wanted $500 up front and could not guarantee they would not ask for more, maybe thousands of dollars more, for prototypes, demo's, advertising, etc. i didn't do it. do you guys think i missed out? they sent all my sketches back with a confidentiality agreement signed by the owner.||||reg||14
Z||000001||Cheever2||01-03-2001||11:29 PM||||Spend about $25 and make an appointment with a Patent Attorney.  That will be money well spent.  <P>Doesn't mean the other group was ripping you off, but for that amount everything should be spelled out & itemized what the money is used for.  Were you going to them to have THEM do the work, or were you simply wanting your idea "protected"?<P>Either way, you can't go wrong seeing a patent attorney first.  But prepare yourself with a list of every question you can think of.  He/she will be happy to answer all of them.  When you make the appointment, just tell the receptionist how much time you think the initial discussion will take (maybe 20-30 minutes, more if you already have a lot of information about your idea that you can show).<P><BR>------------------<BR><I>Chuck Hodges</I><p>[This message has been edited by Cheever2 (edited 01-03-2001).]||||reg||6
Z||000002||80's BOY||01-03-2001||11:34 PM||||thanks chuck. BTW, this company is claiming to put together "the entire package" from prototype to final product advertising. then if it's a big hit, they get %10 from now on. once they "help" me get my idea off the ground, it's a gamble that some big company would want to put their name on the product that i invented. then i would sell-out, and earn profit from the big company i sold out to. ||||reg||1
